From a62a61a3fab546f0c5adbdaeebae9ae51dc24b7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 10:05:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(seo): submit only indexable, canonical URLs in sitemaps
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- seo-config: SITEMAP_MIN/MAX_BS_YEAR (current BS year ±10), isSitemapYear,
  NOINDEX_EXACT_ROUTES and sitemapExclusionReason() mirroring Worker robots rules
- build-calendar-r2: single writer of calendar/day sitemaps, window-limited,
  deletes stale files, stable per-year <lastmod>, manifest kept in sync
- generate-seo: no longer emits archive sitemaps; index entries carry <lastmod>
- festivals / community-archives sitemaps filtered + index <lastmod>
- sanitize-seo-output: keep index <lastmod>
- worker: shared seo-window cutoff; seo-static serves /sitemap*.xml and
  /robots.txt from ASSETS first with crawler-safe headers, 404 when missing
- verify-seo-build: size/count/well-formedness/orphan/duplicate/noindex guards
- tests: seo-discovery contract reflects the indexable window

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01V4iK4B23CEoeVgRUfFi3kC
